    <briefdescription>
<para>Specifies the location and type of a single stream in the minidump file. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>The minidump stream directory is an array of entries of this type, with its size given by <ref refid="structllvm_1_1minidump_1_1_header_1a255d6e4cb11c68599f007278b07bdf86" kindref="member">Header.NumberOfStreams</ref>. </para>
